<title>USA: PHLX to list Sangstat Medical, Synovus Financial.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list Sangstat Medical, Synovus Financial.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Wednesday it will begin trading options on Sangstat Medical Corp and Synovus Financial Corp. on April 1.</p>
<p>Gateway Partners will be specialist for Sangstat Medical, which will have a January expiration cycle. Synovus Financial will have a February expiration cycle, with Spear Leeds Kellogg the specialist, PHLX said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Derivatives Desk 312-408-8750))</p>
